OL,3,GNEWSAGreen light for new #3.5m health
OL,4,Acentre in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new #3.5m medical facility
OL,7,Fon the outskirts on Oakham have been
OL,8,Fapproved.
OL,10,FRutland County Council members voted to
OL,11,Fgive the green light to the Medi-Tech
OL,12,Fcentre, planned for Oakham Enterprise
OL,13,FPark, with unanimous approval at a
OL,14,Fmeeting on Tuesday night.
OL,16,FThe government-funded building will
OL,17,Fserve as a day procedure hub where
OL,18,Fminor surgeries like carpal tunnel
OL,19,Ftreatment and vasectomies will be
OL,20,Fcarried out.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
