OL,3,GNEWSAGreen light for new #3.5m health
OL,4,Acentre in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ground floor will host a raft of
OL,7,Fmedical spaces including consultation
OL,8,Frooms, theatres and recovery zones
OL,9,Fwhile MRI scanning will be provided for
OL,10,Fwithin a dedicated diagnostics pad.
